"A 6.54x42mm cartridge, loaded with a 100 gr. FMJ bullet.  Inspired by the "
"improved .270 British, Alexander Sarafanov himself developed the 6.54x42mm "
"rifle cartridge for his new SVS-24 Assault Rifle."
