#. ~ Description for pair of binoculars
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of optics with a neck strap attached.  Useful for seeing long "
"distances.  Simply carrying or wearing this item in your inventory will "
"double the distance that is mapped around you during your travels.  You "
"could also use them to focus the sunlight."
